<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Carrel — Rust dependency notices</title>
<style>
body { margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; max-width: 70ch; font: 16px/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif; }
pre { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: anywhere; font: 14px/1.5 monospace; }
section { margin-block: 3rem; border-top: 1px solid; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Rust dependency notices</h1>
<p>This inventory covers the locked native and webview graph for Carrel's release
targets, including build dependencies. Some listed crates are used by another
target or only during the build. Fonts and icons have separate bundled notices.</p>
{{#each licenses}}
<section>
<h2>{{name}}</h2>
<ul>
{{#each used_by}}
<li>{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}{{#if crate.repository}} — {{crate.repository}}{{/if}}</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
</section>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
